      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If your project was created with Unity 2018.4, you can fix it with EsnyaUnityTools.\nhttps://github.com/esnya/EsnyaUnityTools\nHowever, sharing the project with git will force the Program Source to be dereferenced. This is true not only for the prefab itself, but also when you overwrite the Program Source property of prefab instances on the scene.\nThis happens in both UdonGraph and UdonSharp.\nIn the current VRChat SDK3, prefabs including Udon Behaviour are completely unusable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
